              "elements": [
                {
                  "id": "efe61311",
                  "elType": "widget",
                  "widgetType": "heading",
                  "isInner": false,
                  "settings": {
                    "_title": "Subheading",
                    "_css_classes": "gp-subheading",
                    "title": "Work completed",
                    "header_size": "h2"
                  },
                  "elements": []
                },
                {
                  "id": "2b660431",
                  "elType": "widget",
                  "widgetType": "text-editor",
                  "isInner": false,
                  "settings": {
                    "_title": "Copy",
                    "_css_classes": "gp-copy",
                    "editor": "<ul><li>A three-page listing audit recording public-page observations.</li><li>A five-page optimisation report containing a description draft, keyword research and category options.</li><li>An action-plan document setting out priorities, assets to retain and possible future work.</li></ul><p>The report researched seven phrases: family secrets thriller, family murder mystery, family secrets mystery, family mystery book, missing person mystery book, family thriller books and family secrets book. These were recommendations. Saved backend keyword fields and measured search volumes were not supplied.</p><figure class=\"gp-case-evidence\"><img src=\"{{asset:grandfather-keyword-research-1103.webp}}\" width=\"1103\" height=\"605\" alt=\"Keyword research table from the project report, showing seven researched phrases\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"{{asset:grandfather-keyword-research-720.webp}} 720w, {{asset:grandfather-keyword-research-1103.webp}} 1103w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 720px) calc(100vw - 48px), 760px\"><figcaption>Unchanged research-table region from the case-study PDF, page 4. It records research and recommendations, not verified saved KDP fields.</figcaption></figure><p>The PDF also reproduces description excerpts. Its final supplied paperback copy includes Reader Views review text, which remains attributed to that source rather than being claimed as newly written project copy.</p>"
                  },
                  "elements": []
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
