                  "widgetType": "text-editor",
                  "isInner": false,
                  "settings": {
                    "_title": "Copy",
                    "_css_classes": "gp-copy",
                    "editor": "<p><a href=\"{{url:amazon-visibility}}\">Amazon Book Visibility</a> addresses the public-facing listing issues illustrated here. <a href=\"{{url:book-strategy}}\">Book Marketing Strategy</a> places those priorities within a wider plan. Description work is also covered by <a href=\"{{url:book-presentation}}\">Book Descriptions &amp; A+ Content</a>.</p><p><a class=\"gp-button gp-button-secondary\" href=\"https://grantpublishingco.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/My-Dear-Grandfather-Listing-Case-Study.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Read the original case study PDF <span class=\"gpc-sr-only\">(opens in a new tab)</span></a></p><p class=\"gp-small\">PDF · 7 pages · 719.6 KiB (736,855 bytes)</p><p class=\"gp-small\">Source: the supplied My Dear Grandfather listing case-study PDF, including its original screenshot, research extracts and explicitly qualified ranking observations.</p>"
